vaporizer2: vaporizer2 (VAST Dynamics Vaporizer2 hybrid synthesizer)
vaporizer2:
vaporizer2: Vaporizer2 is a hybrid wavetable additive/subtractive synthesizer
vaporizer2: with a wavetable editor, sampler, MSEG/LFO modulation, step
vaporizer2: sequencer, arpeggiator and a large effects section.
vaporizer2: This package has the LV2, VST3 and CLAP plugins, the standalone
vaporizer2: JACK/ALSA application and the factory presets, wavetables and
vaporizer2: noises in /usr/share/Vaporizer2.
vaporizer2:
vaporizer2: Homepage: https://github.com/VASTDynamics/Vaporizer2
